---
import crUK from "../images/logos/cr_uk_logo.png";
import act from "../images/logos/act_logo.webp";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import "../styles/donate.css";
---

<section id="donate" class="section section--donate">
    <div class="inner-container">
        <h2 class="section__title">Donate</h2>
        <div class="donate__text">
            <p>Your donation saves lives.</p>

            <p class="fade">
                When you support <strong>Cancer Research UK</strong>, you're
                funding the scientists and clinical trials bringing breakthrough
                treatments closer to reality. Survival rates have doubled in
                four decades, but with 1 in 2 people facing a cancer diagnosis,
                there's urgent work ahead. Just £24 funds an hour of vital
                research. £100 supports a researcher for half a day,
                accelerating discoveries that could save thousands of lives.
            </p>

            <p class="fade">
                <strong>Addenbrooke's Charitable Trust</strong> transforms care for
                patients and families today. Your gift funds the crucial extras the
                NHS can't provide—pioneering diagnostic equipment that detects cancer
                earlier, comfort rooms where families receive difficult news with
                dignity, and specialist support services that help patients cope and
                maintain hope through treatment. These aren't luxuries; they're lifelines.
            </p>

            <p class="fade">
                Cancer doesn't discriminate, and neither should access to
                world-class research and compassionate care. Whether cancer has
                touched your life or you want better outcomes for those it will
                affect, your donation creates immediate impact. Research finds
                tomorrow's cures. Enhanced care improves today's patient
                experience. Both give families precious time together.
            </p>

            <p class="fade">
                <strong>Choose your impact:</strong> Support Cancer Research UK for
                breakthrough research, Addenbrooke's Charitable Trust for enhanced
                patient care, or split your gift between both. Every penny fights
                cancer. Make your donation below.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="donate">
            <a
                href="https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="beneficiary glass"
            >
                <Image
                    src={crUK}
                    alt="Cancer Research UK"
                    class="beneficiary__logo"
                />
            </a>
            <a
                href="https://act4addenbrookes.org.uk/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="beneficiary glass"
            >
                <Image
                    src={act}
                    alt="Addenbrooke's Charitable Trust"
                    class="beneficiary__logo"
                />
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
